    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta00_popup_text_D|145642",
      "en": "You must talk to the Council to gain access to the Wards.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta00_popup_text_D|148499",
      "en": "The keeper scan has been uploaded to the database.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta00_popup_text_D|148500",
      "en": "You do not have the proper keycard.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta00_popup_text_D|163019",
      "en": "Get to the Quarian and warn her before it's too late!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135437",
      "en": "Hey, Commander Shepard! It's me, Conrad Verner! Remember me?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135438",
      "en": "There are rumors on the extranet that you've been made the first human Spectre! That's incredible!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135439",
      "en": "Is that really... wow! It's you!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135440",
      "en": "You're Commander Shepard, the hero of Eden Prime! I am so honored to meet you!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135441",
      "en": "Uh, no. No, I'm just a fan. One of your biggest fans, actually.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135442",
      "en": "My name is Conrad. Conrad Verner. They say you killed more than a hundred geth on Eden Prime!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135443",
      "en": "Hey, I know you're probably busy, but do you have time for a quick autograph?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135444",
      "en": "Thanks. I really appreciate it. My wife is going to be so impressed!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135445",
      "en": "I'll let you get back to work, but next time you're on Earth, I'd love to buy you a drink! Thanks again!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135446",
      "en": "Oh, I see how it is. Commander Shepard doesn't have time for the little people!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135447",
      "en": "Far be it for me to get in your way! You go be a hero.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135450",
      "en": "Nice to meet you. And you are...?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135451",
      "en": "Do I know you? ",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135453",
      "en": "They say a lot of things. I was too busy killing them to count.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135454",
      "en": "I spent most of the time trying to stay alive and help the colonists.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135455",
      "en": "Here you go.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135456",
      "en": "Anything for a fan. Here.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135458",
      "en": "I don't have time for this, Conrad. I'm not here to be a role model.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135462",
      "en": "Pleasure's all mine.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135463",
      "en": "Hello.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135464",
      "en": "Who are you?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135466",
      "en": "Really.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135467",
      "en": "I just tried to help.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135468",
      "en": "Leave me alone.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135469",
      "en": "I suppose.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135470",
      "en": "No problem.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135471",
      "en": "What? No.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135604",
      "en": "Commander! I've been waiting for you to get back!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135605",
      "en": "I've got an idea, and I wanted to run it by you.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135606",
      "en": "Great! This will just take a minute.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135607",
      "en": "With so many human colonies being attacked, I'm not sure that one Spectre is enough.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135608",
      "en": "What if you signed me on as another Spectre?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135609",
      "en": "But I'd make a great Spectre! I'd be right there with you, showing the Council what humanity is capable of!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135610",
      "en": "Joke if you want, but there were people who didn't believe in you, and you worked out, right?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135611",
      "en": "Because I want to show the Council what humanity can do, just like you! I'd make a great Spectre!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135612",
      "en": "I know you're afraid to trust people after losing your team at Akuze, but I'd never let you down!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135613",
      "en": "I want to be with you, fighting the good fight, like you did on Elysium during the Skyllian Blitz!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135614",
      "en": "I read about what you did on Torfan. I'm not afraid to do whatever it takes to get the job done!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135615",
      "en": "W--What? Please, please don't hurt me! Why are you doing this?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135616",
      "en": "I thought you were a hero! Heroes don't do things like this!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135617",
      "en": "What? I don't understand.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135618",
      "en": "You-- You're right. I just got so caught up in all of it. I wanted to help.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135619",
      "en": "I'll go home. Thanks for setting me straight.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135620",
      "en": "Oh, so just because I'm not some hotshot soldier, I can't possibly make it as a Spectre?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135621",
      "en": "The vids are all talking about \"Commander Shepard fighting for all of us back home.\"",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135622",
      "en": "And your grace and skill have inspired a whole legion of admirers, too!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135623",
      "en": "And they also say that you don't take crap from anybody! You're showing them what humans can do.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135624",
      "en": "You remember me? Wow.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135625",
      "en": "Guys must try to talk to a lady like you all the time, but you remember me. That really means something.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135626",
      "en": "Even while you're out there kicking ass, you don't forget the rest of us. That says a lot about you, Shepard.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135627",
      "en": "Hey, could I get your picture?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135628",
      "en": "Are you kidding? Nobody will believe I talked with the beautiful Commander Shepard unless I get a picture!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135629",
      "en": "You're a hero, Shepard. Decades from now, humanity is going to remember you. And I'll have your picture.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135630",
      "en": "Just hold up your gun. Perfect!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135631",
      "en": "Thanks again, Commander! I'm going to hang this in my living room! My wife will love it!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135633",
      "en": "Why the hell would I care about this, Conrad? I've been nice, but you're wasting my time.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135634",
      "en": "I've got a lot going on right now, but I can spare a moment.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135636",
      "en": "What's on your mind?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135638",
      "en": "Conrad, I don't think that's a good idea.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135640",
      "en": "Conrad, I haven't been shot in the head nearly enough times to make that seem like a good idea.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135642",
      "en": "Why would you want to be a Spectre, Conrad?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135644",
      "en": "Okay, let's see. I'm a bad guy. Stop me from killing you.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135645",
      "en": "What about your wife, Conrad? She trusts you, too. Aren't you letting her down?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135646",
      "en": "This is what the Blitz felt like, Conrad! You like it?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135647",
      "en": "I believe you, Conrad. But there's another fight that needs you.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135648",
      "en": "Conrad, you have no idea what it takes to get the job done.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135649",
      "en": "Because you're not a soldier, Conrad. You can't handle this. Go home.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135650",
      "en": "This is how a gun in your face feels! It happens to me every day! You can't handle this.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135652",
      "en": "If you're really willing to do whatever it takes, you'll go home, Conrad.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135653",
      "en": "You know what keeps me going out here? Knowing that people back home are keeping humanity strong.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135654",
      "en": "Conrad, I don't need you. Your wife does. So get out of here.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135656",
      "en": "Conrad, you're not Spectre material, even if I had that kind of pull.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135658",
      "en": "Being a Spectre is a big responsibility. I just want to make humanity proud.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135662",
      "en": "Right. Conrad. We talked awhile back.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135666",
      "en": "I don't have a problem with it, but... why?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135669",
      "en": "Sure. No problem.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135671",
      "en": "I don't have time for this crap! Go back to whatever hole you crawled out of!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135673",
      "en": "Again? No.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135674",
      "en": "Conrad, I'm pretty busy.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135675",
      "en": "Go ahead.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135678",
      "en": "I'm afraid not.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135679",
      "en": "You've got to be kidding.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135680",
      "en": "What?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135684",
      "en": "Here's a test.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135685",
      "en": "Let's talk about trust.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135686",
      "en": "There are no good fights",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135687",
      "en": "There are other fights.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135688",
      "en": "That's a load of crap.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135689",
      "en": "It's not that easy.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135690",
      "en": "It's not going to happen.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135691",
      "en": "This isn't your fight.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135692",
      "en": "You need to learn.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135693",
      "en": "You're pathetic.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135695",
      "en": "I need people at home.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135696",
      "en": "Just be yourself.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135697",
      "en": "Go away.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135700",
      "en": "I'll do my best.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135701",
      "en": "Oh, it's you.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135708",
      "en": "I suppose.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135709",
      "en": "Go ahead.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135710",
      "en": "No! Get out of here!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135741",
      "en": "I wish I'd never met you!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135742",
      "en": "You were too busy to talk last time, but that's not a problem. I know you're busy, being the first human Spectre and all!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135743",
      "en": "This will be fast. I just wanted you to know what a big fan I am, and I was wondering if I could get a picture.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135744",
      "en": "So that's how it is? The rest of us should just let you reap the fame and glory?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135745",
      "en": "You're not the only one who can stand up for humanity! I'll show you!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135747",
      "en": "There's a lot going on right now. Is there something I can do for you?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135748",
      "en": "I apologize for being short with you before. What do you need?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135751",
      "en": "Get lost.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135752",
      "en": "What is it?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135753",
      "en": "Sorry.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|135754",
      "en": "Get lost.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|153724",
      "en": "It's a bad idea.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|153725",
      "en": "No.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|159534",
      "en": "It's a bad idea.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|159535",
      "en": "No.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|159536",
      "en": "It's a bad idea.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta20_trig_fan_D|159537",
      "en": "No.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_market_buyer_D|84655",
      "en": "Best place on this ward to buy upgrades.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_market_buyer_D|84656",
      "en": "Prices are pretty good here.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_market_buyer_D|84657",
      "en": "Have you been to the Emporium up on the Presidium?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_market_buyer_D|84658",
      "en": "Try the markets downstairs if you can't find what you're looking for.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_market_conversation_D|84611",
      "en": "I don't think you bought this here. I don't sell this model.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_market_conversation_D|84612",
      "en": "Look, I know it was you. I remember your face.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_market_conversation_D|84613",
      "en": "Really? That's impressive. Usually you humans can't tell one turian from another.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_market_conversation_D|84614",
      "en": "This was the place. Now are you going to give me a refund or not?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_market_conversation_D|84615",
      "en": "Do you have your proof of purchase?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_market_conversation_D|84616",
      "en": "What! No, I-- I don't think you ever gave me one.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_market_conversation_D|84617",
      "en": "I'm sorry, then. I can't help you.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_market_conversation_D|84618",
      "en": "But--",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_market_conversation_D|84619",
      "en": "Can't help you.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_market_conversation_D|84620",
      "en": "This isn't a proof of purchase.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_market_conversation_D|84621",
      "en": "It's a bank statement. It shows that I bought something from you and when I bought it.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_market_conversation_D|84622",
      "en": "Well, thank you for buying from me, but this still doesn't prove you purchased that item from my store.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_market_conversation_D|84623",
      "en": "But I didn't buy anything else here!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_market_conversation_D|84624",
      "en": "How do I know that? If you don't have the proof of purchase I can't help you.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_market_conversation_D|84625",
      "en": "But--",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_market_conversation_D|84626",
      "en": "Sorry.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_market_conversation_D|85074",
      "en": "Oh, sure, I can return that for you.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_market_conversation_D|85334",
      "en": "Thanks. It hasn't worked well since I bought it.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_market_conversation_D|85335",
      "en": "Hey, are you refunding his stuff?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_market_conversation_D|85336",
      "en": "Here you go. Your account will be credited.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_market_conversation_D|85337",
      "en": "You did! You took his return. Look, I'm telling you I bought this here. Why won't you return it?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_market_conversation_D|85338",
      "en": "I can't take it back unless--",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_amb_market_conversation_D|85339",
      "en": "I know, I know.. unless I have a proof of purchase.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_expat_D|85835",
      "en": "Hello, Earth-clan. No doubt you've just come back from the colonies. Will you be needing supplies?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_expat_D|85836",
      "en": "Most excellent. I am sure you will find something pleasing.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_expat_D|85837",
      "en": "As you say, Earth-clan. Good day to you.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_expat_D|85838",
      "en": "Show me what you've got.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_expat_D|85839",
      "en": "I think I'll be going.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_expat_D|85840",
      "en": "Yes.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_expat_D|85841",
      "en": "No, thanks.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_expat_D|89513",
      "en": "Oh, my mistake, Earth-clan. I assumed... it doesn't matter.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_expat_D|89514",
      "en": "Feros, Noveria? Well, if you haven't heard of them yet, I'm sure you will soon.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_expat_D|89515",
      "en": "But it doesn't matter where you hail from, my goods are available to all.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_expat_D|89516",
      "en": "Welcome back, Earth-clan. Will you be needing supplies for your return to the colonies?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_expat_D|89517",
      "en": "What colonies are you talking about?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_expat_D|89520",
      "en": "Colonies",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_expat_D|104623",
      "en": "It's an old Prothean world. Their buildings still litter the surface.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_expat_D|104624",
      "en": "The humans aren't the first to colonize it, but they are the most recent.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_expat_D|104625",
      "en": "Hmm. I just realized I haven't heard from my contact on that planet for some time.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_expat_D|104626",
      "en": "Ah, well. I'm sure he's fine.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_expat_D|104627",
      "en": "The corporate capital of the Attican Traverse. Very cold, very snowy.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_expat_D|104628",
      "en": "I don't get too many clients from there. They all have their own private suppliers.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_expat_D|104631",
      "en": "I should be going.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_expat_D|104632",
      "en": "I'd like to know more about Feros.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_expat_D|104636",
      "en": "What can you tell me about Noveria?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_expat_D|104638",
      "en": "What have you got?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_expat_D|104640",
      "en": "Feros",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_expat_D|104641",
      "en": "Noveria",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_expat_D|104643",
      "en": "Goodbye.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_expat_D|104647",
      "en": "Let me see your goods.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA60_02a_DSG_LOC|sta60_expat_D|145023",
      "en": "Let me see your goods.",
      "tr": ""
    }
  ]
